direction: right
title: Linux Kernel Container Primitives

NS: 1. Namespaces (Visibility) {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  pid: "PID (Process tree)"
  net: "NET (veth, loopback, port 8080)"
  mnt: "MNT (Private rootfs)"
  user: "USER (Map root to non-root UID)"
}

CG: 2. Control Groups (Quotas) {
  style.fill: "#1C1917"
  style.stroke: "#F59E0B"
  cpu: "CPU CFS Bandwidth (cpu.max)"
  mem: "Memory Limit (memory.max -> OOM 137)"
  blk: "BlkIO (Disk read/write IOPS)"
}

OFS: 3. OverlayFS (Layered Storage) {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
  upper: "UpperDir: Writable layer"
  lower3: "App Layer (app.jar)"
  lower2: "JRE Layer (binaries)"
  lower1: "Distroless RootFS"
  upper -> lower3 -> lower2 -> lower1
}
